WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.960
For me, you know, the talks were really, really easy.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.680
In my mind I wanted to stay here and continue

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.720
what we've been building on

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.400
and really excited to get going and do that.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
We’re so happy 

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.120
that we’ve been able to extend

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.360
with the best player in the world until 2029.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.360
Harry Kane, the Ballon d'Or winner, is staying with us.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.240
We want to continue the success story

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.280
we’ve written in recent years.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.320
I think he’s shown his value for us

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.640
over the last three and a half years.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.680
A character both on and off the pitch -

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.040
a character that we need

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.920
to win the biggest titles.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.160
We won the double.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.600
The Champions League is the big goal now

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.000
for Harry and for us.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.160
And Harry has the opportunity

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.960
to help us there with his qualities.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.200
You really can talk about

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.000
a perfect match here.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.080
He’s an incredible leader,

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.200
so calm.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.280
First of all, there’s his goals.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.640
His statistics are incredible.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.840
Plus his assists.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.400
But also how he works for the team.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.320
That’s what makes him who he is,

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.920
also as a person.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:59.800
He’s just a very strong character.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.720
I feel like we have an amazing team.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.200
Amazing coach.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.440
We're on the verge of something really special

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.440
with this club,

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.000
and I'm extremely proud

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.880
to be a part of it.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.640
If you look at Harry’s development,

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.800
you’ll see that we signed

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.120
one of the best strikers in the world in 2023.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.000
But he’s just continued to develop with us

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.520
into the best player in the world.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.160
And if you watch him on the pitch -

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.480
I think he’s got 156 goals in 161 games,

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.200
but he has an impact on the game,

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.640
he shapes the game,

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.400
he motivates his teammates.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.800
He’s much more than just a striker

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.720
in so many ways. He’s a playmaker,

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.520
a quarterback like in the NFL.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.760
That’s why he was rightfully chosen

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.160
as the best footballer in the world,

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
because he does such amazing things

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.960
for the team - for himself - but also for the team.

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:47.480
That’s why I think Harry Kane and Bayern

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.640
are simply the perfect fit.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.360
It’s just a great relationship.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.160
It means a lot to FC Bayern.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:57.760
That we’re strong as a club, as a team.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.520
That players feel at home here.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.120
That they have big goals with us

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.520
and that they can achieve

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.200
the biggest goals at Bayern.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.280
Otherwise, players like Harry Kane

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:06.840
wouldn’t want to extend their contract with us.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.800
Yeah, I just feel at home here at Bayern Munich.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.800
I love the players, love the fans,

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.240
love the club, the city.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.960
Me and my family are really settled here.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.120
So, yeah, just extremely happy.

